## Django configuration

Set `DJANGO_SECRET_KEY` to a unique secret in your environment before running
management commands. Set `DJANGO_DEBUG=1` only for local development; production
defaults to debug off. Set `DJANGO_ALLOWED_HOSTS` to a comma-separated list of
hostnames before deployment, then run `python manage.py check --deploy`.

